/P 1882 0 R
/T (Many followers of Christ sincerely desire to obey God, yet they often experience an inner conflict. They want to love, but anger rises. They want to forgive, but resentment remains. They want to trust God, yet fear seems stronger than faith.)
/E (Many followers of Christ sincerely desire to obey God, yet they often experience an inner conflict. They want to love, but anger rises. They want to forgive, but resentment remains. They want to trust God, yet fear seems stronger than faith.)
/Pg 32 0 R
