2429 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1882 0 R
/E (This struggle does not necessarily mean your faith is weak. It means there is a battle taking place within you. The Bible describes this as the conflict between the flesh and the Spirit. Understanding this battle is essential because victory begins when we recognize both the source of the conflict and the One who gives us the power to overcome it.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
