/E (Little by little, the fruit of the Spirit becomes evident in our lives: Love. Joy. Peace. Patience. Kindness. Goodness. Faithfulness. Gentleness. Self-control. These qualities are not produced by human effort alone; they are the work of God's Spirit within us.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [4]
>>
