2516 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1886 0 R
/E (The Christian life is not a single moment of victory but a daily walk of surrender. Each day we choose whom we will follow. Will we allow fear or faith to guide us? Will we respond with pride or humility? Will we seek our own desires or God's will? Jesus calls us to deny ourselves, take up our cross daily, and follow Him. Every act of surrender becomes another step toward spiritual maturity. The more we walk with Christ, the more His life is reflected in ours.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
