/P 1889 0 R
/T (Transformation does not begin by changing our circumstances. It begins by changing the way we think. Before coming to Christ, our minds were shaped by the values of the world, our personal experiences, and our own understanding. We learned to think independently of God, often measuring success, happiness, and purpose by human standards.)
