2753 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 1896 0 R
/T (When Jesus began His earthly ministry, His first message was not about religion. It was about the Kingdom of God. Throughout the Gospels, Jesus continually spoke about God's Kingdom because He came not only to forgive our sins but to restore us to God's rule.)
