2754 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 1896 0 R
/T (Many people think becoming a Christian simply means preparing for heaven. The Bible teaches something much greater. Through Jesus Christ, we are invited to live under God's Kingdom today.)
