/P 1898 0 R
/T (Although we live in this world, we no longer belong to its values. Our identity... Our loyalty... Our hope... Our purpose... are now found in Christ. As citizens of God's Kingdom, we are called to represent our King wherever we live. Our homes become places where Christ reigns. Our workplaces become opportunities to reflect His character. Our churches become communities that display His love. Every area of life becomes an opportunity to honor our King.)
