2921 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 1902 0 R
/T (Many people admire Jesus. Many believe in Jesus. Many speak about Jesus. But Jesus never invited people merely to admire Him. He invited them to follow Him. Following Jesus is more than agreeing with His teachings. It is choosing Him every day. It is allowing His life to shape our lives. His words to shape our thinking. His love to shape our relationships. His purpose to become our purpose. The Christian life is not simply believing certain truths. It is walking with a living Savior. Every day.)
/E (Many people admire Jesus. Many believe in Jesus. Many speak about Jesus. But Jesus never invited people merely to admire Him. He invited them to follow Him. Following Jesus is more than agreeing with His teachings. It is choosing Him every day. It is allowing His life to shape our lives. His words to shape our thinking. His love to shape our relationships. His purpose to become our purpose. The Christian life is not simply believing certain truths. It is walking with a living Savior. Every day.)
/Pg 52 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
