endobj
2942 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1903 0 R
/E (Throughout the Gospels, Jesus repeatedly gave the same invitation. "Follow Me." He spoke those words to fishermen. To tax collectors. To ordinary men and women. He did not first ask about their education. Their wealth. Their abilities. He simply invited them into a relationship with Himself. The call has not changed. Today Jesus still says, "Follow Me." Discipleship always begins with His invitation.)
/Pg 53 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
