3264 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 1916 0 R
/T (How do we know that Christ is transforming our lives? Is it by how much we know? By how many Bible verses we can quote? By how often we attend church? These are valuable, but Jesus taught that a transformed life is recognized by its fruit.)
/E (How do we know that Christ is transforming our lives? Is it by how much we know? By how many Bible verses we can quote? By how often we attend church? These are valuable, but Jesus taught that a transformed life is recognized by its fruit.)
/Pg 66 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
3265 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 1916 0 R
/T (Just as a healthy tree naturally bears healthy fruit, a life that remains in Christ will gradually reflect His character. The fruit of the Spirit is not something we manufacture through human effort. It is the evidence that the Holy Spirit is living and working within us. God is not only interested in changing what we do. He desires to change who we are.)
/E (Just as a healthy tree naturally bears healthy fruit, a life that remains in Christ will gradually reflect His character. The fruit of the Spirit is not something we manufacture through human effort. It is the evidence that the Holy Spirit is living and working within us. God is not only interested in changing what we do. He desires to change who we are.)
/Pg 66 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
