/Pg 68 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
3290 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 1918 0 R
/T (People may never read the Bible. But they will read our lives. They will notice how we respond when we are hurt. How we treat difficult people. How we speak. How we forgive. How we serve. The fruit of the Spirit becomes a living testimony of Christ's presence within us. Our lives become the message before our words are ever heard.)
/E (People may never read the Bible. But they will read our lives. They will notice how we respond when we are hurt. How we treat difficult people. How we speak. How we forgive. How we serve. The fruit of the Spirit becomes a living testimony of Christ's presence within us. Our lives become the message before our words are ever heard.)
/Pg 68 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
3291 0 obj
<<
