/P 1918 0 R
/T (4. Growing Through Every Season)
/E (4. Growing Through Every Season)
/Pg 68 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
3292 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 1918 0 R
/T (Fruit does not appear overnight. Neither does spiritual maturity. God often uses every season of life to help us grow. Times of joy teach us gratitude. Trials teach us perseverance. Waiting teaches us trust. Success teaches us humility. Failure teaches us dependence. In every season, the Holy Spirit is shaping us into the image of Jesus Christ. Nothing in the hands of God is wasted. Every experience can become part of our spiritual growth.)
/E (Fruit does not appear overnight. Neither does spiritual maturity. God often uses every season of life to help us grow. Times of joy teach us gratitude. Trials teach us perseverance. Waiting teaches us trust. Success teaches us humility. Failure teaches us dependence. In every season, the Holy Spirit is shaping us into the image of Jesus Christ. Nothing in the hands of God is wasted. Every experience can become part of our spiritual growth.)
/Pg 68 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
