/P 1920 0 R
/E (Thank You for giving me Your Holy Spirit. Thank You for patiently transforming my life day by day. Produce within me the character of Jesus Christ. Help me to love as He loved. To rejoice in every circumstance. To live in Your peace. To be patient, kind, faithful, gentle, and self-controlled. May my life become a testimony that points others to You. Continue Your work in me until Christ is fully reflected through my life.)
