3365 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 1921 0 R
/T (Every follower of Jesus carries a divine purpose. God did not save us merely to prepare us for heaven. He saved us so that His light might shine through us here on earth. Jesus never said, "Try to become the light." He said, "You are the light of the world." Because Christ, the True Light, lives within us, His light is now reflected through our lives. The world is filled with darkness. Darkness of fear. Darkness of confusion. Darkness of loneliness. Darkness of sin. Yet wherever Christ is present, His light begins to overcome the darkness. As disciples, we are called to live in such a way that people see Jesus through us.)
/E (Every follower of Jesus carries a divine purpose. God did not save us merely to prepare us for heaven. He saved us so that His light might shine through us here on earth. Jesus never said, "Try to become the light." He said, "You are the light of the world." Because Christ, the True Light, lives within us, His light is now reflected through our lives. The world is filled with darkness. Darkness of fear. Darkness of confusion. Darkness of loneliness. Darkness of sin. Yet wherever Christ is present, His light begins to overcome the darkness. As disciples, we are called to live in such a way that people see Jesus through us.)
/Pg 71 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
