3406 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1923 0 R
/E (The moon has no light of its own. It shines because it reflects the light of the sun. The same is true for every believer. We are not the source of spiritual light. Christ is. Our calling is simply to reflect His life to the world around us.)
/Pg 73 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
3407 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1923 0 R
/E (When people experience our love... our kindness... our humility... our forgiveness... they should see something beyond us. They should catch a glimpse of Jesus Christ. The brighter our relationship with Him becomes, the brighter His light shines through us.)
/Pg 73 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
