/E (3. Light Changes Everything)
/Pg 74 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
3427 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1924 0 R
/E (Light does not argue with darkness. It simply shines. The moment light enters a dark room, darkness begins to disappear. Jesus calls us to live this way. Instead of responding to hatred with hatred, we answer with love. Instead of spreading fear, we bring hope. Instead of increasing division, we become peacemakers. Instead of hiding our faith, we courageously live for Christ. The greatest sermon many people will ever hear is the testimony of a life transformed by Jesus.)
/Pg 74 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
