3537 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1929 0 R
/E (Love does not begin with us. It begins with God. Before we ever loved Him, He loved us. He pursued us when we were lost. He forgave us when we were guilty. He welcomed us through Jesus Christ. Every act of genuine Christian love flows from the love we have first received from our heavenly Father. The more we understand His love for us, the more naturally we love others.)
/Pg 79 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
