3557 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1930 0 R
/E (Jesus raised the standard of love. He did not simply say, "Love others as they love you." He said, "Love one another as I have loved you." His love was humble. His love was patient. His love was forgiving. His love was truthful. His love was sacrificial. He loved even those who rejected Him.)
/Pg 80 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
3558 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1930 0 R
/E (To follow Jesus is to allow His love to shape the way we speak, serve, forgive, and respond to others. This kind of love cannot be produced by human effort alone. It is the work of the Holy Spirit within us.)
/Pg 80 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
