<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1931 0 R
/E (Love is more than words. It is demonstrated through everyday actions. We show love by: Forgiving those who hurt us. Encouraging those who are discouraged. Serving without seeking recognition. Listening with compassion. Giving generously. Praying for others. Speaking the truth with grace. Love often appears in small acts of faithfulness that reveal the heart of Christ. Every act of love becomes an opportunity for someone to experience God's kindness.)
/Pg 81 0 R
/K [5]
>>
