/P 1932 0 R
/E (The world is searching for authentic love. When believers love one another with humility, patience, and grace, they reveal something extraordinary. They reveal Jesus. Our love becomes a testimony more powerful than arguments. It opens hearts. It heals wounds. It builds unity. It points people to the Savior. Love is not simply one Christian virtue among many. It is the atmosphere in which all the other virtues flourish.)
/Pg 82 0 R
