3639 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 1935 0 R
/T (The Christian life does not end with personal transformation. It begins there. Jesus never called His followers simply to believe in Him. He called them to follow Him... to become like Him... and then to help others do the same.)
/E (The Christian life does not end with personal transformation. It begins there. Jesus never called His followers simply to believe in Him. He called them to follow Him... to become like Him... and then to help others do the same.)
/Pg 85 0 R
/K [6]
>>
