3640 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 1935 0 R
/T (Every disciple is called to make disciples. This is not about building our own reputation or gathering followers for ourselves. It is about pointing people to Jesus Christ, helping them grow in faith, and encouraging them to walk faithfully with Him. Discipleship is the natural overflow of a life transformed by the Gospel.)
