3657 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1936 0 R
/E (A disciple is more than someone who possesses knowledge about Jesus. A disciple is a learner, a follower, and an obedient servant of Christ. A disciple listens to Jesus. Trusts Jesus. Obeys Jesus. Lives for Jesus. And becomes increasingly like Jesus. Discipleship is not measured by how much information we have. It is measured by how faithfully we live what Christ has taught us.)
/Pg 86 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
