/P 1936 0 R
/E (Before Jesus returned to the Father, He entrusted His mission to His followers. This was not a suggestion. It was a commission. The Great Commission reminds us that every believer has a purpose. Some serve in their homes. Some in their workplaces. Some in churches. Some across nations. Wherever God places us, we are called to represent Christ and help others know Him. The mission field begins wherever God has planted us.)
/Pg 86 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
