/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1938 0 R
/E (One disciple reaches another. That disciple reaches another. Generation after generation, the Gospel continues to spread. This was God's design from the beginning. The Church grows not merely by gathering crowds, but by multiplying faithful disciples. Our greatest legacy is not what we accumulate. It is the people we have encouraged, equipped, and pointed toward Christ. When we invest our lives in others, the impact of the Gospel extends far beyond our own lifetime.)
/Pg 88 0 R
/K [1]
>>
