4042 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 1955 0 R
/T (Why did God create us? Why did Christ redeem us? Why has the Holy Spirit transformed us? Why are we called to follow Jesus, bear fruit, love others, and make disciples?)
/E (Why did God create us? Why did Christ redeem us? Why has the Holy Spirit transformed us? Why are we called to follow Jesus, bear fruit, love others, and make disciples?)
/Pg 105 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
4043 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 1955 0 R
/T (The answer is found in one beautiful purpose: To glorify God. The highest purpose of every believer is not personal success. It is not recognition. It is not comfort. It is not even ministry itself. Our greatest purpose is to know God, enjoy Him, and glorify Him with every part of our lives. When God's glory becomes the center of our lives, every ordinary moment gains eternal significance.)
/E (The answer is found in one beautiful purpose: To glorify God. The highest purpose of every believer is not personal success. It is not recognition. It is not comfort. It is not even ministry itself. Our greatest purpose is to know God, enjoy Him, and glorify Him with every part of our lives. When God's glory becomes the center of our lives, every ordinary moment gains eternal significance.)
/Pg 105 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
