4077 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 1957 0 R
/T (Notice how comprehensive this is. God is not glorified only during worship services. He is glorified in our homes. In our work. In our conversations. In our decisions. In our relationships. In moments of joy. In seasons of hardship. Every part of life becomes an opportunity to worship God through faithful living. There is no divide between the "spiritual" and the "ordinary" life. For the disciple, all of life belongs to God.)
/E (Notice how comprehensive this is. God is not glorified only during worship services. He is glorified in our homes. In our work. In our conversations. In our decisions. In our relationships. In moments of joy. In seasons of hardship. Every part of life becomes an opportunity to worship God through faithful living. There is no divide between the "spiritual" and the "ordinary" life. For the disciple, all of life belongs to God.)
/Pg 107 0 R
/K [3]
>>
