4114 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1959 0 R
/E (As we conclude this course, remember that discipleship is not a destination. It is a lifelong journey. There will always be more to learn. More opportunities to grow. More people to love. More ways to serve. More reasons to trust God. The purpose of this course has never been merely to increase knowledge. It has been to encourage a lifelong walk with Jesus Christ. As you continue your journey, let every step bring glory to the One who called you out of darkness into His marvelous light.)
/Pg 109 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
