13587 0 obj
<<
/Title (Every journey has moments of excitement. Every journey also has moments of weariness. The Christian life is no different. There are days when our faith feels strong. There are seasons when God's presence seems especially near. But there are also times of waiting... times of suffering... times of unanswered questions... and times when we feel like giving up. Jesus never hid these realities from His disciples. Instead, He encouraged them to remain faithful. The Christian life is not measured by how quickly we begin. It is measured by how faithfully we continue. God calls us not only to believe, but to endure with hope until the end.)
/Dest [98 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 13580 0 R
