13709 0 obj
<<
/Title (The greatest evidence of a transformed life is not found in impressive words or remarkable abilities. It is found in love. From the beginning of His ministry to the cross, Jesus demonstrated the love of the Father. He welcomed the outcast. He forgave sinners. He healed the broken. He served the humble. He laid down His life for the world. When we follow Jesus, His love becomes the pattern for our lives. Christian love is not merely a feeling. It is a decision to seek the good of others, even when it requires sacrifice. Love is the language of the Kingdom of God.)
